    "Verify deployed portal login and parent record linkage",
    "Verify WhatsApp Business sender and approved onboarding template",
    "Verify communication permission and exclude opt-outs",
    "Reconcile normalized phone numbers to parent accounts; exclude shared or ambiguous account matches",
    "Approve a fresh start date if proposed dates pass"
  ],
  "message_template": "EAGLE POWER SCHOOLS — PARENT PORTAL\n\nDear {{parent_name}}, our portal helps you view your linked child’s fee statements, report cards, homework and academic profile.\n\nLogin: https://eaglepowerschools.com.ng/portal/login\nYour username: {{username}}\nUse the private password already issued by the school. If you have not received it or cannot sign in, contact the school office for secure account assistance. Never share passwords or login codes.\n\nWHATSAPP HELP\nMessage the school WhatsApp number +2349075580671 and type Hello to start. Follow the login instructions, then reply with a menu number or ask one question in plain English, such as “How much is my child owing?”, “What homework does my child have?” or “When is school resuming?” Personal records are available only after account verification. If the bot cannot help, ask to contact the school office.\n\nTo stop school broadcasts, reply STOP. For help, reply HELP.",
  "readiness_rule": "Describe only features verified end-to-end immediately before activation. No password extraction, no shared passwords, no automatic password resets.",
  "delivery_rules": [
    "Recheck opt-out before each send",
    "Persist claim before sending and provider message identifier after acknowledgement",
    "Do not repeat completed recipients after restarts",
    "Hold ambiguous or failed sends for review; do not retry blindly",
    "Pause on provider restrictions, template rejection, recipient complaints, or delivery-quality warnings",
    "Use only verified, authorized parent account mappings; never infer a login from a phone alone"
  ],
